\newlabel{fig:hold_comparison}{{10}{37}{All five hold trajectories at 2500~K over the final 30~ps of each run. The $g(r)$, coordination and tetrahedral-order curves are indistinguishable between potentials. The MSD is linear and unbounded for every potential, confirming a fully diffusive liquid; \texttt {26.almtp} is the only visible outlier and also the only 0.4~ns run}{figure.caption.22}{}}
